# Icon sheet 2, 2026-10-26: padlock, flag, compass, upgrade arrow, check mark.
# 12x12, ink outline, light from the upper left. Research notes: ../README.md

# Locked. A steel shackle (an arch on two legs) over a brass body with a keyhole.
@asset icon_padlock
size 12 12
budget 8
key a=ink h=steel5 m=steel3 s=steel2 H=gold5 g=gold4 G=gold2
frame
